# Flaky Test Analyzer (eFMS/eTMS)

Full workflow: `.cursor/skills/flaky-test-analyzer/SKILL.md` · `ruleAi.md` Section 18.

## Quick diagnose (order)

1. Positional XPath / dynamic `_ngcontent` / `nth-child` → rewrite (Section 3.4)
2. `time.sleep()` or literal `wait_for_timeout(ms)` → `settings` + condition waits
3. **Run FAIL, debug PASS** → race — not slower sleep
4. Grid empty but title OK → `ListGridComponent.wait_for_data_rows()`
5. ng-select wrong value → `NgSelectComponent`, not raw click
6. Overlay intercept → wait `.block-ui-active` gone
7. Headless sidebar/title → viewport 1920×1080 + `dashboard_ready_selectors`
8. Commercial nav order → `goto_dashboard` between scenarios
9. Services → `shipment-item-wrapper`, not datatable
10. BR delete → `delete_booking_receipt_from_grid()` only

## Verify fix

5+ consecutive headed runs + 1 headless run before marking done.
